INSERT INTO `resume_suggestions` VALUES (1,'Section Completeness','2026-10-27 15:09:55.182948','The resume appears to be missing a dedicated \'Education\' section.','','PENDING','Add an explicit heading for \'Education\' with structured bullet points.','### Education\n- Include relevant details, dates, and concise bullet points.',2),(2,'Section Completeness','2026-10-27 15:09:55.182948','The resume appears to be missing a dedicated \'Work Experience / Internships\' section.','','PENDING','Add an explicit heading for \'Work Experience / Internships\' with structured bullet points.','### Work Experience / Internships\n- Include relevant details, dates, and concise bullet points.',2),(3,'Section Completeness','2026-10-27 15:09:55.190746','The resume appears to be missing a dedicated \'Projects\' section.','','PENDING','Add an explicit heading for \'Projects\' with structured bullet points.','### Projects\n- Include relevant details, dates, and concise bullet points.',2),(4,'Section Completeness','2026-10-27 15:09:55.190746','The resume appears to be missing a dedicated \'Contact Information (Email / Phone / LinkedIn)\' section.','','PENDING','Add an explicit heading for \'Contact Information (Email / Phone / LinkedIn)\' with structured bullet points.','### Contact Information (Email / Phone / LinkedIn)\n- Include relevant details, dates, and concise bullet points.',2),(5,'Quantifiable Impact','2026-10-27 15:09:55.190746','Bullet points lack measurable metrics (percentages, performance gains, users impacted).','Improved system performance and user experience.','PENDING','Follow Google\'s X-Y-Z formula: \'Accomplished [X], as measured by [Y], by doing [Z]\'.','Improved API throughput by 35% and reduced query latency from 450ms to 95ms through database indexing.',2),(6,'Online Presence','2026-10-27 15:09:55.199168','No GitHub profile link detected in contact information.','Contact details','PENDING','Add your GitHub profile URL at the top so interviewers can review your real source code and contributions.','GitHub: github.com/your-username | LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/your-profile',2),(7,'Section Completeness','2026-10-27 15:10:10.252616','The resume appears to be missing a dedicated \'Education\' section.','','ACCEPTED','Add an explicit heading for \'Education\' with structured bullet points.','### Education\n- Include relevant details, dates, and concise bullet points.',3),(8,'Section Completeness','2026-10-27 15:10:10.261231','The resume appears to be missing a dedicated \'Work Experience / Internships\' section.','','PENDING','Add an explicit heading for \'Work Experience / Internships\' with structured bullet points.','### Work Experience / Internships\n- Include relevant details, dates, and concise bullet points.',3),(9,'Section Completeness','2026-10-27 15:10:10.261231','The resume appears to be missing a dedicated \'Projects\' section.','','PENDING','Add an explicit heading for \'Projects\' with structured bullet points.','### Projects\n- Include relevant details, dates, and concise bullet points.',3),(10,'Section Completeness','2026-10-27 15:10:10.261231','The resume appears to be missing a dedicated \'Contact Information (Email / Phone / LinkedIn)\' section.','','PENDING','Add an explicit heading for \'Contact Information (Email / Phone / LinkedIn)\' with structured bullet points.','### Contact Information (Email / Phone / LinkedIn)\n- Include relevant details, dates, and concise bullet points.',3),(11,'Quantifiable Impact','2026-10-27 15:10:10.261231','Bullet points lack measurable metrics (percentages, performance gains, users impacted).','Improved system performance and user experience.','PENDING','Follow Google\'s X-Y-Z formula: \'Accomplished [X], as measured by [Y], by doing [Z]\'.','Improved API throughput by 35% and reduced query latency from 450ms to 95ms through database indexing.',3),(12,'Online Presence','2026-10-27 15:10:10.269067','No GitHub profile link detected in contact information.','Contact details','PENDING','Add your GitHub profile URL at the top so interviewers can review your real source code and contributions.','GitHub: github.com/your-username | LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/your-profile',3),(13,'Action Verbs & Impact','2026-10-27 15:54:01.411055','Found generic phrase \'worked on\' instead of a specific technical contribution.','Worked on database queries and UI components...','PENDING','Specify exact architectural or engineering contribution: \'Architected\', \'Designed\', \'Optimized\'.','Optimized complex relational SQL queries and developed reusable responsive UI components...',5),(14,'Action Verbs & Impact','2026-10-27 16:21:03.833441','Found generic phrase \'worked on\' instead of a specific technical contribution.','Worked on database queries and UI components...','PENDING','Specify exact architectural or engineering contribution: \'Architected\', \'Designed\', \'Optimized\'.','Optimized complex relational SQL queries and developed reusable responsive UI components...',7),(15,'Section Completeness','2026-10-27 16:21:49.567186','The resume appears to be missing a dedicated \'Contact Information (Email / Phone / LinkedIn)\' section.','','PENDING','Add an explicit heading for \'Contact Information (Email / Phone / LinkedIn)\' with structured bullet points.','### Contact Information (Email / Phone / LinkedIn)\n- Include relevant details, dates, and concise bullet points.',8),(16,'Action Verbs & Impact','2026-10-27 16:21:49.583099','Found passive phrase \'responsible for\', which weakens ownership of accomplishments.','Responsible for building API endpoints...','PENDING','Replace \'responsible for\' with proactive verbs such as \'Engineered\', \'Orchestrated\', or \'Developed\'.','Engineered scalable RESTful API endpoints reducing response latency by 20%...',8),(17,'Quantifiable Impact','2026-10-27 16:21:49.583099','Bullet points lack measurable metrics (percentages, performance gains, users impacted).','Improved system performance and user experience.','PENDI