r-username | LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/your-profile',9),(23,'Section Completeness','2026-11-01 04:42:38.987599','The resume appears to be missing a dedicated \'Work Experience / Internships\' section.','','PENDING','Add an explicit heading for \'Work Experience / Internships\' with structured bullet points.','### Work Experience / Internships\n- Include relevant details, dates, and concise bullet points.',10),(24,'Section Completeness','2026-11-01 04:42:38.992492','The resume appears to be missing a dedicated \'Projects\' section.','','PENDING','Add an explicit heading for \'Projects\' with structured bullet points.','### Projects\n- Include relevant details, dates, and concise bullet points.',10),(25,'Section Completeness','2026-11-01 04:42:38.997492','The resume appears to be missing a dedicated \'Skills\' section.','','PENDING','Add an explicit heading for \'Skills\' with structured bullet points.','### Skills\n- Include relevant details, dates, and concise bullet points.',10),(26,'Online Presence','2026-11-01 04:42:39.001504','No GitHub profile link detected in contact information.','Contact details','PENDING','Add your GitHub profile URL at the top so interviewers can review your real source code and contributions.','GitHub: github.com/your-username | LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/your-profile',10);
